If you would like to insert the document if it is not found, you can use the upsert option.

Example
Update the document, but if not found insert it:

db.posts.updateOne( 
 { title: "Post Title 5" }, 
 {
 $set: 
 {
 title: "Post Title 5",
 body: "Body of post.",
 category: "Event",
 likes: 5,
 tags: ["news", "events"],
 date: Date()
 }
 }, 
 { upsert: true }
)

